+canonical maps. Custom memory hooks receive private copies in the original
+allocation order and can use the existing fallback if either allocation
+fails. After changing the mapping rows, the register lists or their enums,
+run `python3 suite/synctools/x86_operand_specializations.py` and its
+`--check` mode. The mapping unit compares every 16-bit opcode with the
+canonical instruction map.
